(SCORING DURING THE GAME) Tj T*
(- Completed road: 1 point per tile.) Tj T*
(- Completed city: 2 points per tile and 2 points per pennant \(shield\).) Tj T*
(- Completed monastery \(surrounded by 8 tiles\): 9 points.) Tj T*
(If several players have followers on the same completed feature, the player with the) Tj T*
(most followers scores all the points. On a tie, all tied players score the full) Tj T*
(points.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(END OF THE GAME) Tj T*
(The game ends after the last tile is placed. Then incomplete features score:) Tj T*
(- Incomplete road: 1 point per tile.) Tj T*
(- Incomplete city: 1 point per tile and 1 point per pennant.) Tj T*
(- Incomplete monastery: 1 point plus 1 point per tile around it.) Tj T*
(- Fields: each farmer field scores 3 points for each completed city it touches.) Tj T*
(The player with the most points wins.) Tj T*
ET
